                "tuning.coil.limits.can_desc": "Adjust magnetic pull strength and cycle frequency within the range allowed by the spring gauge.",
                "tuning.coil.limits.cannot": "Voltage CANNOT:",
                "tuning.coil.limits.cannot_desc": "Fix fatigued springs, a pitted contact screw, loose binding posts, or mismatched capacitor microfarads. Cranking voltage on an untuned coil causes severe sparking, hot coils, and rapid contact erosion.",
                "tuning.maintenance_link": "Need mechanical spring alignment or coil maintenance steps? Open Machine Maintenance Logbook.",
